{title: Tum Jo Mil Gaye Ho}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Madan Mohan}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]tum jo mil gaye ho,        [G]to ye lagataa hain
[B]ke jaha [A]an mil [Dm]gayaa,        [B]ke jaha [A]an mil [Dm]gayaa
[F]yek bhatake huye [G]raahee ko,        [G]kaarawaan mil [Dm]gayaa [A]
[Dm]baithho naa door hum se,        [G]dekho khafaa [F]naa ho
[F]kismat se mil [G]gaye ho,        mil ke judaa [F]n ho
[Dm]meree kyaa [G]khataa hai,        [Dm]hotaa hain ye bhee [A]
[Dm]ke jamee se bhee kabhee,        [B]aasa [A]maan mil [Dm]gayaa
[Dm]tum bhee the khoye khoye,        [G]main bhee buzaa [F]buzaa
[F]thaa ajanabee [G]jamaanaa,        apanaa koee [F]n thaa
[Dm]dil ko jo [G]mil gayaa hai,        [Dm]teraa sahaaraa [A]
[Dm]yek naee jindagee kaa,        [B]nish [A]aa mil [Dm]gayaa
